        "lang": "en",
        "chapterNumber": "1",
        "chapterTitle": "How the Divine Revelation started being revealed to Allah's Messenger",
        "intro": "<p>And the Statement of Allah جَلَّ ذِكْرُهُ: \"Verily, We have sent the revelation to you (O Muhammad ﷺ) as We sent the revelation to Noah and the Prophets after him.\" (V.4:163)</p>",
        "ending": null
      },
      {
        "lang": "ar",
        "chapterNumber": "1",
        "chapterTitle": "باب كَيْفَ كَانَ بَدْءُ الْوَحْىِ إِلَى رَسُولِ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم",
        "intro": "<p>وَقَوْلُ اللَّهِ جَلَّ ذِكْرُهُ: {إِنَّا أَوْحَيْنَا إِلَيْكَ كَمَا أَوْحَيْنَا إِلَى نُوحٍ وَالنَّبِيِّينَ مِنْ بَعْدِهِ}</p>",
        "ending": null
      }
